<title>USA: ShopKo sees robust sales, margins trends.</title>
<headline>ShopKo sees robust sales, margins trends.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-04-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>ShopKo Stores Inc said it is continuing to see robust trends in sales and margins</p>
<p>In a conference call with analysts, chief operating officer Bill Podany said the company is experiencing a significant turnaround in the hardline sector, which includes all items except apparel, and domestic linens and trimmings.</p>
<p>The softline business, which includes those other items, also is doing well, he said.</p>
<p>&quot;Business remains very, very good,&quot; he said.</p>
<p>((--Robin Sidel, 212/859-1723))</p>
</text>
